codex
The first implementation is in place: a responsive editorial storefront, live timestamp preview, configurable cut/size, Stripe-hosted checkout, and a post-payment fulfillment endpoint that creates a Scalable Press design, quote, and order. I’m now testing the build and the API contract before deployment; one deliberate assumption is that this benchmark’s Scalable Press sandbox accepts the reference-compatible DTG product IDs.
